sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Operator
    participant Client as Web / Mobile Client
    participant AuthAPI as /api/v1/auth
    participant Security as Security & JWT Core
    participant DB as User Database

    User->>Client: Enter Phone / Credentials
    Client->>AuthAPI: POST /api/v1/auth/login (Credentials)
    AuthAPI->>DB: Query User Record & Verify Hash (bcrypt)
    DB-->>AuthAPI: User Profile & Role (CITIZEN / RESPONDER / ADMIN)
    AuthAPI->>Security: Generate Access Token (JWT, HS256)
    Security-->>AuthAPI: Signed Token + Expiry Timestamp
    AuthAPI-->>Client: HTTP 200 {access_token, token_type, user_profile}
    Client->>Client: Secure Token Storage (SecureStore / LocalStorage)
    
    Note over Client,AuthAPI: Subsequent Authenticated Requests
    Client->>AuthAPI: Request with Header Authorization: Bearer <token>
    AuthAPI->>Security: Validate Signature & Claims
    Security-->>AuthAPI: Validated Identity & Role
    AuthAPI-->>Client: Authorized Resource Response
